\# GCE Business Rules

\#\# Purpose

This rule ensures that all business logic implemented in the GCE platform follows the official business documentation.

Business documentation is the single source of truth.

Never invent, simplify, or modify business workflows unless explicitly instructed.

\---

\# Canonical Sources of Truth

Highest business authority — Founder Decisions:

\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-001_Business_Model.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-020_Financial_and_Wallet_Architecture.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-021_Settlement_Engine.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-022_Membership_Lifecycle.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-023_RBAC_and_Permissions.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-024_GCE_Connect_Circle_Lifecycle.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-025_Connect_BDP_Commercial_and_Operating_Architecture.md\`
\- \`docs/founder-decisions/FD-026_GCE_Enterprise_Business_and_Operating_Architecture.md\`
\- `docs/founder-decisions/FD-027_Membership_Commercial_and_Operating_Architecture.md`

Then living cores:

\- Roles / legacy mapping: \`35\_Role\_Taxonomy.md\`
\- Commercial numbers: \`36\_Commercial\_Constants.md\`
\- Revenue flows: \`37\_Revenue\_Flow.md\`
\- Circles: \`38\_Circle\_Architecture.md\` (defers to FD-024)
\- AI Lead Assist: \`39\_AI\_Lead\_Assist\_Spec.md\`

Always use full vertical names: GCE Connect, GCE Marketplace, GCE Enterprise.
Approved BDP short names: Connect BDP, Marketplace BDP, Enterprise BDP.
Never invent Unresolved / Pending Founder Approval items.

